{
"p": "Prof. Anirudh Dhawan, faculty in the Finance & Accounting area at IIMB, has been appointed Subject Editor at the Journal of International Financial Markets, Institutions and Money (JIFMIM), a leading international peer-reviewed journal."
},
{
"p": "Prof. Dhawan’s research interests at IIMB span behavioural finance, financial markets and experimental finance, with his editorial appointment bringing this expertise to the journal’s evaluation and development of research in the field."
},
{
"p": "JIFMIM publishes rigorous, original research on the international dimensions of financial markets, institutions and monetary systems, including the evolving dynamics of foreign-currency-denominated transactions and their implications for financial markets."
},
{
"p": "The journal is ranked A in the Australian Business Deans Council (ABDC) Journal Quality List and 3 in the Academic Journal Guide (ABS)."
}
